<import src="../../components/states.wxml"/>
<view class="page"><template is="feedback" data="{{loading,error}}"/><block wx:if="{{!loading &amp;&amp; !error}}">
<view class="eyebrow">EVERY LITTLE EFFORT SHINES</view><view class="heading">让坚持，被看见。</view><view class="subtitle">每一份认真生活的努力，都在这里闪光。</view><view class="hero section"><view class="row"><view class="grow"><text class="pill light">{{rank.city}} · 累计打卡榜</text><view class="hero-title">走得慢一点，也没关系。</view><view class="hero-desc">我们比的不是速度，是照顾自己的每一天。</view></view><image class="rank-art" src="/images/ui/rank.svg"/></view></view><view class="notice mt">模拟榜单，仅展示昵称与签到天数。榜单不发放名次奖励，不展示体重与健康照片。</view><view class="card section"><view class="rank-header row"><text>轻动伙伴</text><text>累计坚持</text></view><view wx:for="{{rank.rows}}" wx:key="nickname" class="rank-row {{item.isMe ? 'mine' : ''}}"><text class="rank-no {{item.rank &lt;= 3 ? 'top-rank' : ''}}">{{item.rank}}</text><view class="avatar small">{{item.initial}}</view><view class="grow"><text class="title">{{item.nickname}}</text><text wx:if="{{item.isMe}}" class="pill mine-tag">我</text><text wx:else class="caption">轻动伙伴 · 模拟示例</text></view><text class="rank-days">{{item.days}}<text class="unit">天</text></text></view></view><view class="card mt"><view class="row"><view class="grow"><view class="title">我的坚持 {{rank.myDays}} 天</view><view class="caption">{{rank.participating ? (rank.myDays ? '已开启公开榜展示，谢谢你的分享。' : '已开启公开榜，签到后就能看见自己。') : '你尚未开启公开榜，记录仍然属于自己。'}}</view></view><button class="btn soft small" data-url="/pages/privacy/index" bindtap="go">管理展示</button></view></view>
</block><view class="footnote">轻动 · 每一步坚持，都值得被看见</view></view>
